WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.545 --> 00:00:18.009
"I love half days at school," Nina said.

2
00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:20.465
She and Izzie were on their way to Kids Central.

3
00:00:20.466 --> 00:00:22.815
"Me too!" Izzie said.

4
00:00:22.816 --> 00:00:28.294
"We get to be with Miss Shelly all afternoon!"

5
00:00:28.295 --> 00:00:31.726
The girls joined the others in the gym.

6
00:00:31.727 --> 00:00:36.059
"Did everyone bring warm clothes?" Miss Shelly asked.

7
00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:40.712
"I did!" Bobby pulled on a wool hat with ear flaps.

8
00:00:40.713 --> 00:00:44.357
Jason lifted his leg to show his snow boots.

9
00:00:44.358 --> 00:00:47.119
Ethan looked out the window and shivered.

10
00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:50.930
The sun was shining, but there was snow on the ground.

11
00:00:50.931 --> 00:00:54.152
"Are we really going outside today?"

12
00:00:54.153 --> 00:00:56.541
"Yep," Miss Shelly said.

13
00:00:56.542 --> 00:00:59.307
"I want to show you something."

14
00:00:59.308 --> 00:01:02.278
Ethan didn't look too happy.

15
00:01:02.279 --> 00:01:05.014
"The sun's warm," Jason said.

16
00:01:05.015 --> 00:01:07.638
"And there's snow," Bobby added.

17
00:01:07.639 --> 00:01:13.792
"We can build a fort!"

18
00:01:13.793 --> 00:01:18.203
When they got outside, everyone gathered around a picnic table.

19
00:01:18.204 --> 00:01:21.449
There was a funny-looking box sitting on the table.

20
00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:24.752
"What's that?" Izzie asked.

21
00:01:24.753 --> 00:01:28.447
"It's a solar oven," Miss Shelly said.

22
00:01:28.448 --> 00:01:31.262
"It cooks with the heat of the sun.

23
00:01:31.263 --> 00:01:34.507
I use it when I go camping."

24
00:01:34.508 --> 00:01:37.167
Jason wrinkled his nose.

25
00:01:37.168 --> 00:01:39.527
"How does it work?" he asked.

26
00:01:39.528 --> 00:01:42.295
"There's no gas or electricity."

27
00:01:42.296 --> 00:01:47.133
"We cooked with solar ovens on the beach in California!" Ethan said.

28
00:01:47.134 --> 00:01:49.416
"Sunlight is the fuel.

29
00:01:49.417 --> 00:01:53.825
The shiny metal reflects the sun and creates heat."

30
00:01:53.826 --> 00:01:57.362
"That's right, Ethan," Miss Shelly said.

31
00:01:57.363 --> 00:02:01.494
"But I didn't know they worked in cold weather," Ethan said.

32
00:02:01.495 --> 00:02:06.428
"You can cook with the sun any time of year," Miss Shelly said.

33
00:02:06.429 --> 00:02:10.865
"Today we're going to make sweet potato fries."

34
00:02:10.866 --> 00:02:15.138
"Mmm," Nina said. "What do we do?"

35
00:02:15.139 --> 00:02:17.866
Miss Shelly had a bag of supplies with her.

36
00:02:17.867 --> 00:02:21.824
She pulled out sweet potatoes, olive oil and salt.

37
00:02:21.825 --> 00:02:25.932
She also had a knife and a cutting board.

38
00:02:25.933 --> 00:02:32.169
"First, we slice these sweet potatoes into strips like french fries.

39
00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:37.829
Then we coat them with oil and sprinkle on salt."

40
00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:44.132
"Sounds easy," Jason said. "Good!"

41
00:02:44.133 --> 00:02:49.218
When the potatoes were ready, Miss Shelly slid the pan inside the solar oven.

42
00:02:49.219 --> 00:02:51.026
"Are you cold, Ethan?

43
00:02:51.027 --> 00:02:54.361
We can go back inside while the fries cook."

44
00:02:54.362 --> 00:02:55.953
Ethan shook his head.

45
00:02:55.954 --> 00:02:57.847
"Nope. Jason was right.

46
00:02:57.848 --> 00:03:01.617
The sun feels warm." He looked at Bobby.

47
00:03:01.618 --> 00:03:06.760
"What were you saying about building a fort?"

48
00:03:06.761 --> 00:03:11.457
Soon the kids were busy piling snow in a big mound.

49
00:03:11.458 --> 00:03:14.563
They dug out the center so they could all fit.

50
00:03:14.564 --> 00:03:18.623
Forty minutes later Miss Shelly went over to the oven.

51
00:03:18.624 --> 00:03:21.975
"Who wants some sweet potato fries?"

52
00:03:21.976 --> 00:03:28.606
"Me!" The kids came piling out of the snow fort. "I do!"

53
00:03:28.607 --> 00:03:31.555
Miss Shelly held out the pan.

54
00:03:31.556 --> 00:03:34.401
The fries looked brown and crispy.

55
00:03:34.402 --> 00:03:38.097
"Let's go inside to eat," Miss Shelly said.

56
00:03:38.098 --> 00:03:41.533
"Can we come back out later?" Ethan asked.

57
00:03:41.534 --> 00:03:44.596
"Absolutely!" Miss Shelly agreed.

58
00:03:44.597 --> 00:03:48.612
"Today we've got all afternoon to play."

59
00:03:48.613 --> 00:03:52.960
On the way back inside, Bobby turned to Ethan.

60
00:03:52.961 --> 00:03:55.559
"Did you know you can surf on snow?"

61
00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:58.724
"Huh?" Ethan was confused.

62
00:03:58.725 --> 00:04:00.791
"It's called snowboarding.

63
00:04:00.792 --> 00:04:03.431
My dad is taking me this weekend.

64
00:04:03.432 --> 00:04:05.994
Maybe you can come with us."

65
00:04:05.995 --> 00:04:09.321
"That would be awesome!" Ethan grinned.

66
00:04:09.322 --> 00:04:21.007
"The cold isn't so bad when you're having fun!"
